"29024220", "id": "18062057783754667", "text": "Great", "timestamp": 1785693469, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "genxwannabe", "author_id": "74463152638", "id": "18047797724804171", "text": "What if you’re feeling numbness 😞", "timestamp": 1785484749, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "lucin_foodblog", "author_id": "53564591849", "id": "18124813525707453", "text": "❤️", "timestamp": 1785272727, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "avadocherty1", "author_id": "76172755476", "id": "17884245222457695", "text": "❤️🙏", "timestamp": 1785196499, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "monstro_do_marao", "author_id": "32944211027", "id": "18121891963762888", "text": "🔥🙌❤️🔥🙌", "timestamp": 1785155580, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kyleejkienitz", "author_id": "20174332", "id": "17884272090609151", "text": "Where have you been all my life 😭", "timestamp": 1785132362, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "alberta.girl", "author_id": "5388913", "id": "17895536646561281", "text": "Every emotion is acceptable - none of them are wrong. Every emotion teaches. This took me a long time to learn, because I'd been taught that I was not to feel any of them. What I finally learned was that every emotion was ok, that they were gifts. I also learned that what was important, was how I handled each emotion. Rage, anger - perfectly fine to feel . What was not fine was to let it splatter onto the innocent - that these were gifts to ME. What I worked through and what resulted when I got things figured out, how it changed me, became gifts to those around me.", "timestamp": 1785072632, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jus_lov29", "author_id": "72755660950", "id": "18100947073920327", "text": "🔥🔥💙🔥🔥", "timestamp": 1785069265, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "camillesullivan0127", "author_id": "7673297567", "id": "18122104087762713", "text": "Experience is a good teacher, lessons learned, move now toward blessings ‼️💯 #JustDoIt💗💜", "timestamp": 1785023776, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "eugenie065", "author_id": "283691728", "id": "18136657729576053", "text": "I  love your way of thinking thanks❤️", "timestamp": 1784899281, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "c__4__t", "author_id": "15225223330", "id": "17928145455370011", "text": "Thank you 🙏", "timestamp": 1784894901, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "c__4__t", "author_id": "15225223330", "id": "18087994175439388", "text": "Hmmm !", "timestamp": 1784894894, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbAxjRYiiNI/", "webpage_url_basename": "DbAxjRYiiNI", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-mad2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/751348704_882059794528412_2886735414969550180_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=Mzk0NTM3MTIwMTcwMjYwMTU0NA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=Qq-Et97lYe8Q7kNvwENWRqA&_nc_oc=AdqUAFm9wQzqu7GZKeRUZVoD8M485cZ8WHQoGpE8mhMbgJBcK6EwvVbH1rYoxs84DdY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=7eBAS8Hbk9v8NL8_yfdarA&_nc_ss=70a8c&oh=00_AQOALuj6ToOyoWjtTaJv5JKu9SvZ0IN58fSB2Yi5XUJnFQ&oe=6ACF69A9", "display_id": "DbAxjRYiiNI", "fulltitle": "Video by candasifamabarnes", "upload_date": "20260720", "epoch": 1791589522, "format": "dash-2088689201710579v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-2088677011711798a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-2088689201710579v+dash-2088677011711798a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 1389.839, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.01.01.01.00", "vbr": 1334.552, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr": 55.287, "asr": 44100, "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.08.19", "release_git_head": "594bd50c2c78ac432f81600d309fdc4e0a92d82c", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}